{
  "schema": "loom.runtime_profile/1",
  "domain": "ports",
  "revision": 2,
  "description": "Role -> adapter + parameters (B-MOD-03). The installation layer is this preset; <data_dir>/profiles/ports.pack overrides it for the person; a conversation overrides both in conversations.metadata.ports. Resolution goes through the scope chain of the action engine (most specific scope wins unless a conflict rule says otherwise) and `ports explain` names the layer and file of the choice. A role entry is {adapter, params, setting?, param_settings?} or a composition {compose: chain|fallback|ensemble|mirror, members, quorum?, fuse?} (include/loom/port_compose.h). `setting` names the config.json key that supplies params.model; `param_settings` {param: config key} supplies further params the same way (only when the entry does not set them). A role ending in .* matches every role with that prefix. action.<id> (the entry action.*) is the model of one catalogue action: the model step of the action runner (runner.cpp run_use_model) asks for it when the step names no model, and honours only a choice of the person or of the conversation, never the preset. Defaults equal the behaviour before the profile existed; the runtime ASR/OCR path still reads media.pack asr_order/ocr_order until it consumes the role. M1-D1: every role carries label {pl, en} and why {pl, en} (the human name of the job and what it is for); a role whose reader does not resolve the role through the ports yet carries status {state: partial | planned, today {pl, en}, reason {pl, en}, readers}: partial = some readers go through the role, others read the setting directly; planned = no reader resolves the role yet, the role only shows the value. Which flows use a role is data of the action catalogue (actions.pack uses_role); which settings each flow reads is actions.pack reads (checked by tools/check_action_reads.py). The documentation keys (label, why, status) never take part in a choice: port_graph leaves them out of the role-choice node.",
  "defaults": {
    "roles": {
      "chat.default": {"adapter": "openai_chat", "params": {}, "setting": "default_model",
        "label": {"pl": "Rozmowa", "en": "Conversation"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model, który odpowiada w rozmowie (i w działaniach, które nie wskazują innego modelu).", "en": "The model that answers in the conversation (and in actions that name no other model)."},
        "status": {"state": "planned",
          "today": {"pl": "Dziś rozmowa czyta pole default_model sama, przez łańcuch zakresów (rozmowa → jednostki → osoba → instalacja). Krok modelu w działaniach najpierw pyta porty o rolę action.<id> (Model dla działania: tylko Twój wybór albo wybór rozmowy, nigdy preset), dopiero potem czyta default_model z Twoich ustawień. Ta rola pokazuje tę samą wartość, ale jej nadpisanie w profilu ports nie zmienia żadnego modelu.", "en": "Today the conversation reads the field default_model itself, through the scope chain (conversation → units → person → installation). The model step of actions first asks the ports for the role action.<id> (Model for an action: only your choice or the conversation's, never the preset), and only then reads default_model from your settings. This role shows the same value, but overriding it in the ports profile changes no model."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Nikt nie rozwiązuje roli chat.default: rozmowa (chat_engine.cpp), krok modelu w działaniach (runner.cpp — po roli action.<id> pole z action_run.pack use_model.model_setting) i agent (agent.cpp) czytają klucz default_model wprost.", "en": "Nothing resolves the role chat.default: the conversation (chat_engine.cpp), the model step of actions (runner.cpp — after the role action.<id>, the field of action_run.pack use_model.model_setting) and the agent (agent.cpp) read the key default_model directly."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/chat/chat_engine.cpp scoped_default_model", "loom/src/actions/runner.cpp run_use_model", "loom/src/agent/agent.cpp"]}},
      "analysis.fast": {"adapter": "openai_chat", "params": {}, "setting": "semantic_model",
        "label": {"pl": "Analiza w tle", "en": "Background analysis"},
        "why": {"pl": "Tani, szybki model, który w tle czyta wiadomości: encje, tematy, relacje; korzystają z niego też inne prace w tle.", "en": "A cheap, fast model that reads messages in the background: entities, topics, relations; other background jobs use it too."},
        "status": {"state": "partial",
          "today": {"pl": "Przez tę rolę wybierają model tylko dwie polityki: analyzer („Przeanalizuj wiadomość w tle”) i guardian (Sekretarz, krok 3). Pozostałe przepływy z uses_role analysis.fast — i potwierdzenie kosztu ponowienia nieudanych analiz — czytają pole semantic_model wprost, z Twoich ustawień; które to są, mówią dane actions.pack (uses_role, reads), sprawdzane przez tools/check_action_reads.py. Przy pustym polu „Dopracuj elementy archiwum” bierze model rozmowy (archive.pack refinement.model_keys).", "en": "Only two policies choose the model through this role: analyzer (“Analyse a message in the background”) and guardian (the Secretary, step 3). The other flows with uses_role analysis.fast — and the cost confirmation for retrying failed analyses — read the field semantic_model directly, from your settings; which they are is the data of actions.pack (uses_role, reads), checked by tools/check_action_reads.py. With the field empty, “Refine archive items” takes the conversation model (archive.pack refinement.model_keys)."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Te przepływy powstały przed profilem ports i czytają klucz wprost; lista jest w actions.pack (reads, uses_role).", "en": "These flows predate the ports profile and read the key directly; the list is in actions.pack (reads, uses_role)."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/annotations/models.cpp resolve_model (policies analyzer, guardian)"]}},
      "guardian": {"adapter": "openai_chat", "params": {}, "setting": "semantic_model",
        "label": {"pl": "Sekretarz", "en": "Secretary"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model, którym Sekretarz czyta rozmowę, gdy metoda to model lub hybryda. Ta rola wskazuje dziś ten sam klucz co Analiza w tle (semantic_model), nie guardian_model: guardian_model to krok 1 polityki Sekretarza, ta rola to krok 2.", "en": "The model the Secretary reads the conversation with when the method is model or hybrid. Today this role points at the same key as Background analysis (semantic_model), not guardian_model: guardian_model is step 1 of the Secretary's policy, this role is step 2."}},
      "intent.routing": {"adapter": "openai_chat", "params": {}, "setting": "intent_routing_model",
        "label": {"pl": "Rozpoznanie polecenia", "en": "Command recognition"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model, który ocenia, czy wpis jest poleceniem dla aplikacji, gdy rozpoznawanie używa modelu.", "en": "The model that judges whether an entry is a command for the app, when recognition uses a model."},
        "status": {"state": "planned",
          "today": {"pl": "Dziś rozpoznawanie czyta intent_routing_model, a gdy pusty — default_model (model rozmowy), bezpośrednio z config.json (intent_routing.pack method.model_setting i model_fallback_setting); ta rola tylko pokazuje wartość, jej nadpisanie w profilu ports nic nie zmienia.", "en": "Today recognition reads intent_routing_model and, when it is empty, default_model (the conversation model), directly from config.json (intent_routing.pack method.model_setting and model_fallback_setting); this role only shows the value, overriding it in the ports profile changes nothing."},
          "reason": {"pl": "route.cpp model_route nie rozwiązuje ról portów.", "en": "route.cpp model_route does not resolve ports roles."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/actions/route.cpp model_route"]}},
      "image.generate": {"adapter": "openai_images", "params": {}, "setting": "image_model", "param_settings": {"provider": "image_provider"},
        "label": {"pl": "Obraz", "en": "Image"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model, który maluje obraz w działaniu „przedstaw obrazem” (depict), i dostawca, który go obsługuje.", "en": "The model that paints the image in the action “depict”, and the provider that serves it."},
        "status": {"state": "planned",
          "today": {"pl": "Dziś działanie depict bierze model i dostawcę z argumentów albo z pól image_model i image_provider (parametry działania z polem setting); ta rola tylko pokazuje te wartości.", "en": "Today the action depict takes the model and the provider from its arguments or from the fields image_model and image_provider (action params with a setting); this role only shows these values."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Parametry działań z polem setting czyta runner.cpp wprost z config.json, nie przez porty.", "en": "Action params with a setting are read by runner.cpp directly from config.json, not through the ports."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/actions/runner.cpp (params[].setting)", "loom/data/runtime/actions.pack depict"]}},
      "speech.synthesize": {"params": {}, "setting": "speech_model", "param_settings": {"provider": "speech_provider"},
        "label": {"pl": "Głos", "en": "Voice"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model, który czyta tekst na głos w działaniu „opowiedz” (narrate), i jego dostawca; bez niego wynikiem jest sam tekst narracji.", "en": "The model that reads text aloud in the action “narrate”, and its provider; without it the result is the narration text only."},
        "status": {"state": "planned",
          "today": {"pl": "Dziś działanie narrate bierze model i dostawcę z argumentów albo z pól speech_model i speech_provider; domyślnie żaden adapter mowy nie jest zarejestrowany, więc ta rola nie wskazuje adaptera.", "en": "Today the action narrate takes the model and the provider from its arguments or from the fields speech_model and speech_provider; no speech adapter is registered by default, so this role names no adapter."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Parametry działań z polem setting czyta runner.cpp wprost z config.json, nie przez porty.", "en": "Action params with a setting are read by runner.cpp directly from config.json, not through the ports."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/actions/runner.cpp (params[].setting)", "loom/data/runtime/actions.pack narrate"]}},
      "embed.default": {"adapter": "openai_embeddings", "params": {},
        "label": {"pl": "Osadzenia", "en": "Embeddings"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model, który zamienia tekst na wektory do wyszukiwania po znaczeniu.", "en": "The model that turns text into vectors for search by meaning."},
        "status": {"state": "planned",
          "today": {"pl": "Dziś model osadzeń podaje wywołujący (embedding.embed) albo ustawienia wykonania kontekstu (context_execution.embedding); ta rola nie ma pola ustawień i nikt jej nie czyta.", "en": "Today the embedding model is given by the caller (embedding.embed) or by the context execution options (context_execution.embedding); this role has no settings field and nothing reads it."},
          "reason": {"pl": "providers/embedding.cpp i silnik kontekstu nie rozwiązują ról portów.", "en": "providers/embedding.cpp and the context engine do not resolve ports roles."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/providers/embedding.cpp", "loom/src/context/context_engine.cpp (context_execution.embedding)"]}},
      "asr": {"compose": "fallback", "members": ["groq", "google"],
        "label": {"pl": "Mowa→tekst", "en": "Speech→text"},
        "why": {"pl": "Kto zamienia nagranie na tekst (transkrypcja): kolejni dostawcy próbowani po kolei.", "en": "Who turns a recording into text (transcription): providers tried one after another."},
        "status": {"state": "partial",
          "today": {"pl": "Wybór, który zapiszesz w swoim profilu ports albo w rozmowie, czyta dziś tylko działanie Transkrybuj (transcribe; pierwszy dostawca z listy); mikrofon w rozmowie (wejście głosowe) jeszcze nie czyta roli i idzie według profilu mediów. Kolejność z tego presetu nie jest czytana — działa kolejność media.pack asr_order.", "en": "A choice you save in your ports profile or in a conversation is read today only by the action Transcribe (transcribe; the first provider of the list); the microphone in the chat (voice input) does not read the role yet and follows the media profile. The order of this preset is not read — media.pack asr_order applies."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Ścieżka mediów (media_providers.cpp) czyta jeszcze media.pack; runner.cpp patrzy na rolę tylko, gdy nie jest to preset instalacji.", "en": "The media path (media_providers.cpp) still reads media.pack; runner.cpp looks at the role only when it is not the installation preset."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/actions/runner.cpp run_media (chosen_role)"]}},
      "ocr": {"compose": "fallback", "members": ["ocr.space"],
        "label": {"pl": "Tekst ze zdjęcia", "en": "Text from a picture"},
        "why": {"pl": "Kto odczytuje tekst ze zdjęcia lub zrzutu ekranu (OCR).", "en": "Who reads the text from a picture or a screenshot (OCR)."},
        "status": {"state": "partial",
          "today": {"pl": "Wybór, który zapiszesz w swoim profilu ports albo w rozmowie, czyta dziś tylko działanie OCR (ocr; pierwszy dostawca z listy); import zrzutów ekranu jeszcze nie czyta roli i idzie według profilu mediów. Kolejność z tego presetu nie jest czytana — działa kolejność media.pack ocr_order.", "en": "A choice you save in your ports profile or in a conversation is read today only by the action OCR (ocr; the first provider of the list); the import of screenshots does not read the role yet and follows the media profile. The order of this preset is not read — media.pack ocr_order applies."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Ścieżka mediów (media_providers.cpp) czyta jeszcze media.pack; runner.cpp patrzy na rolę tylko, gdy nie jest to preset instalacji.", "en": "The media path (media_providers.cpp) still reads media.pack; runner.cpp looks at the role only when it is not the installation preset."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/actions/runner.cpp run_media (chosen_role)"]}},
      "action.*": {"adapter": "openai_chat", "params": {},
        "label": {"pl": "Model dla działania", "en": "Model for an action"},
        "why": {"pl": "Model jednego działania z katalogu (action.summarise, action.translate, action.depict …): „do streszczeń używaj modelu X”. Preset niczego nie wybiera — działanie bierze wtedy model kroku albo model rozmowy.", "en": "The model of one catalogue action (action.summarise, action.translate, action.depict …): “use model X for summaries”. The preset chooses nothing — the action then takes the step's model or the conversation model."},
        "status": {"state": "partial",
          "today": {"pl": "Czytane przez krok modelu działań (runner.cpp) tylko wtedy, gdy krok nie nazywa modelu, a wybór zapisałeś Ty (profil ports) albo rozmowa (metadata.ports); ten preset nic nie wybiera. Przepływy, które wołają model same (analiza w tle, Sekretarz, rozpoznanie polecenia …), tej roli nie czytają.", "en": "Read by the model step of actions (runner.cpp) only when the step names no model and the choice was saved by you (the ports profile) or by the conversation (metadata.ports); this preset chooses nothing. Flows that call a model themselves (background analysis, the Secretary, command recognition …) do not read this role."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Wybór dla działania ma sens tylko wtedy, gdy ktoś go zrobił; bez niego działa pole default_model (action_run.pack use_model.model_setting).", "en": "A choice for an action only means something when someone made it; without one the field default_model applies (action_run.pack use_model.model_setting)."},
          "readers": ["loom/src/actions/runner.cpp run_use_model (chosen_role)"]}},
      "format.*": {"adapter": "auto", "params": {},
        "label": {"pl": "Formaty plików", "en": "File formats"},
        "why": {"pl": "Kto czyta i zapisuje dany format pliku (format.zip, format.json …); auto = aplikacja rozpoznaje sama.", "en": "Who reads and writes a given file format (format.zip, format.json …); auto = the app recognises it itself."},
        "status": {"state": "planned",
          "today": {"pl": "Dziś importer rozpoznaje format sam (rozszerzenie i zawartość); ta rola nie jest czytana.", "en": "Today the importer recognises the format itself (extension and content); this role is not read."},
          "reason": {"pl": "Importer i eksport nie rozwiązują ról portów.", "en": "The importer and the export do not resolve ports roles."},
          "readers": []}}
    }
  },
  "value_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["roles"],
    "properties": {
      "roles": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Role name -> adapter entry or composition. No role is required and none is capped.",
        "x-setting": "/roles",
        "x-consumer": "loom::PortProfile",
        "additionalProperties": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "adapter": {"type": "string"},
            "params": {"type": "object"},
            "setting": {"type": "string"},
            "param_settings": {"type": "object", "description": "{param: config key}: params the entry does not set come from these settings (like `setting` for params.model).", "additionalProperties": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}},
            "compose": {"type": "string", "enum": ["chain", "fallback", "ensemble", "mirror"]},
            "members": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1},
            "quorum": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
            "fuse": {"type": "object"},
            "label": {"type": "object", "description": "Human name of the job {pl, en}."},
            "why": {"type": "object", "description": "What the role is for {pl, en}."},
            "status": {"type": "object", "description": "Present when a reader does not resolve the role through the ports yet: {state: partial | planned, today {pl, en}, reason {pl, en}, readers[]}."}
          },
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false
  }
}
